{"id":"reference/Integers","kind":"langref","title":"整数","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#Integers","file":"reference/Integers.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"Integers","text":"整数"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Integer-Literals","text":"整数字面量"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Runtime-Integer-Values","text":"运行时整数值"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"Integers\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integers\">整数</a></h2>\n\n      <h3 id=\"Integer-Literals\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Integer-Literals\">整数字面量</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">integer_literals.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> decimal_int = <span class=\"tok-number\">98222</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> hex_int = <span class=\"tok-number\">0xff</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> another_hex_int = <span class=\"tok-number\">0xFF</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> octal_int = <span class=\"tok-number\">0o755</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> binary_int = <span class=\"tok-number\">0b11110000</span>;\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 可以在两个数字之间放置下划线作为视觉分隔符</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> one_billion = <span class=\"tok-number\">1_000_000_000</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> binary_mask = <span class=\"tok-number\">0b1_1111_1111</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> permissions = <span class=\"tok-number\">0o7_5_5</span>;\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> big_address = <span class=\"tok-number\">0xFF80_0000_0000_0000</span>;</code></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"Runtime-Integer-Values\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Integers/#Runtime-Integer-Values\">运行时整数值</a></h3>\n\n      <p>整数字面量没有大小限制；如果发生任何非法行为，编译器都会发现。</p>\n      <p>但是，一旦整数值在编译时不再已知，它就必须具有已知大小，并且可能发生需要安全检查的<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">runtime_vs_comptime.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">divide</span>(a: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>, b: <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">i32</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">return</span> a / b;\n}</code></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>此函数中的值 <code>a</code> 和 <code>b</code> 仅在运行时已知，因此这一除法运算既可能发生<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Integer-Overflow\">整数溢出</a>，也可能发生<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Division-by-Zero\">除数为零</a>。</p>\n      <p><code>+</code> 和 <code>-</code> 等运算符在整数溢出时会导致<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Illegal-Behavior\">非法行为</a>。所有目标平台都提供了回绕运算与饱和运算的替代运算符。<code>+%</code> 和 <code>-%</code> 执行回绕运算，<code>+|</code> 和 <code>-|</code> 执行饱和运算。</p>\n      <p>Zig 支持任意位宽整数，使用字母 <code>i</code> 或 <code>u</code> 后接数字的标识符引用。例如，标识符 <code><span class=\"tok-type\">i7</span></code> 表示七位有符号整数。整数类型允许的最大位宽为 <code><span class=\"tok-number\">65535</span></code>。有符号整数使用<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Two's_complement\">二进制补码</a>表示。</p>\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Illegal-Behavior/#Wrapping-Operations\">回绕运算</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":11,"translated":11}}
